<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>4 - Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>2 - Abel Balbo and Daniel Fonseca (both Roma), Marco Simone and</p>
<p>George Weah (both Milan), Luis Oliveira (Fiorentina), Felippo</p>
<p>Inzaghi (Atalanta)</p>
